00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.012
Lesson 2: The opening: listen, recap, clarify

2
00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:11.390
The first three minutes set the tone. How to take notes, recap without repeating, and ask questions that actually help.

3
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.113
Three things to remember.

4
00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:15.641
Put the goal in a box at the top of your page.

5
