Recap in three sentences, then check you have it right.

6
00:00:19.379 --> 00:00:23.163
Only ask questions whose answers would change your structure.

7
00:00:23.363 --> 00:00:28.103
The full lesson has a worked example, an exercise, and a quick quiz.
